>> a := Uluhlu ← Into ; Inyaniso ; Ubuxoki ; Ibhuliyeni ; 1 ; Inani ; ['Str'] ; Umbhalo ; { ['Empty']. }.
Imveliso bhala: (a inani-lezinto), umgca-omtsha.
{ :i
	Imveliso bhala: 
	['a '] + 
	((a ? i) uhlobo) +
	([' \‘this\’ '] this: (a ? i))  +
	[' is '] +
	(((a ? i) Engenanto?) oku: [''] okanye-oko: ['NOT']) + 
	[' Nil.'],
	umgca-omtsha.
} × (a inani-lezinto).
Imveliso bhala: ['but.. Nil is.. '] + ((Engenanto Engenanto?) oku: ['certainly NIL!'] okanye-oko: ['not NIL??']), umgca-omtsha.